<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stears on Lucent.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bear Stears on Lucent.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said it raised its 1997 earnings per share estimate on Lucent Technologies Inc to $2.10 from $2.00 and boosted its 1998 view to $2.65 from $2.50.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/8 to 54.</p>
</text>
